    "message": "Find where two runs first differ, and the values behind random comparisons\n\nbenchmarks/first_difference.py compares per-phase digests of each part of the world and\nshows the first differing minute, phase, part and values. --draws logs each draw's key and\nwhat it was compared with, which catches a probability that changed without flipping any\ncomparison. gate_all_paths.py gets --reversed-order. The hooks live in benchmarks/tick_probe.py\non TickEngine and CounterRNG; src/ is unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
